1
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:48,040
Xiaoxiao.

2
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:52,120
Did you receive the custom-made dress I bought for you

3
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,040
in Xinzelan City ?

4
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,360
Yes.

5
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,200
I'll go hand over my work.

6
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:57,400
In the evening,

7
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,480
I'll pick you up from the art center.

8
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,160
Zizhou,

9
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,880
you're finally back.

10
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,040
I'll wait for you.

11
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:15,600
Boom.

12
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,760
It's an onomatopoeic sound.

13
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,240
In the early hours of the 11th,

14
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,800
the command tower at the Causeway Cape Strait was struck.

15
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:24,080
At the same time, Bayron Commercial Street collapsed.

16
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,800
Could this be just a coincidence?

17
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:29,000
I need to confirm where Xiaoxiao was on the night of the 10th

18
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:31,440
and if she overheard secrets related to the Strait incident.

19
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,080
She always checked in with us before.

20
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,400
I bet there's a secret

21
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,440
behind this sudden fall.

22
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,160
Zizhou,

23
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:43,520
today I finally started training at Jeton Art Center.

24
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:45,440
The uniforms are so pretty.

25
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,400
I also like the new phone you gave me.

26
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,840
And I've met many new classmates.

27
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:55,040
There's a teacher, Cherry Wong, who came from abroad.

28
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,040
She's our tutor.

29
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,200
She likes me a lot.

30
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,480
Xiaoxiao fell from the fourth floor.

31
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:12,440
She suffered massive blood loss when brought back.

32
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,280
Her vital signs are weak.

33
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:18,200
We still haven't found matching plasma.

34
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,200
All I can do

35
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,040
is to keep her barely alive for now.

36
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,240
Jinning,

37
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,280
I'm not her biological brother.

38
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,880
I can't give her blood.

39
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:28,800
But I know

40
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:30,680
who can save her

41
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:32,640
in this world.

42
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:38,960
The subscriber you dialed cannot be connected temporarily.

43
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:40,840
Please redial later.

44
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:42,240
Is she on a mission?

45
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:44,920
I'll keep calling.

46
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:46,400
Zizhou,

47
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,720
don't panic. Listen to me.

48
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,520
I'm a doctor.

49
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:54,520
If there's the slightest chance, I won't give up on saving her.

50
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:59,080
But there's one thing

51
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,800
you must know.

52
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:06,120
There are multiple needle marks on the veins in Xiaoxiao's arm,

53
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:10,040
proving large amounts of plasma were taken from her within ten days.

54
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:13,200
And her mind was subjected to severe trauma multiple times.

55
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,880
That's why her heart rate keeps accelerating after revival.

56
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,120
I'm afraid

57
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,880
she won't make it.

58
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,200
Her heart rate keeps accelerating?

59
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,240
Large amounts of plasma were taken?

60
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,600
Could it be her blood type

61
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:25,480
was discovered?

62
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:27,600
During this period,

63
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,760
she told us she was in intensive training at the art center.

64
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:33,040
But what happened to her?

65
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:38,360
Xiaoxiao got beaten multiple times over these ten days.

66
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,600
Her body was covered in injuries.

67
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,440
Her right leg was fractured.

68
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:43,760
And the little finger on her left hand had a comminuted fracture.

69
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:44,560
It was likely

70
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,520
crushed by a heel.

71
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,040
What?

72
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,320
Crushed by a heel?

73
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,560
That's ruthless!

74
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,000
Xiaoxiao was extremely timid and cautious.

75
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,400
How could someone do

76
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,120
such vicious things to her?

77
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,360
It's my fault for coming back too late.

78
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,200
Zizhou,

79
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:03,600
there's more.

80
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:04,920
Brace yourself.

81
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,200
She wasn't only beaten,

82
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:09,800
but also subjected to multiple sexual assaults.

83
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:10,880
Multiple

84
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,440
sexual assaults?

85
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:17,840
Cao Fei just sent a message.

86
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:21,600
When Xiaoxiao's phone sent a message at 11:00 PM on the 10th,

87
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,520
its location coordinates were at Doll Bar.

88
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,160
In the early hours of the 11th,

89
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,880
a merchant ship carrying construction materials

90
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,440
collided with the Strait command tower.

91
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:30,920
The boom was likely the sound of the ship colliding

92
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:33,000
and the explosion at Bayron Commercial Street.

93
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,440
Xiaoxiao's fall wasn't an accident.

94
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,160
Someone wanted to silence her.

95
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,280
Doll Bar?

96
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:43,840
It's a Stellarport's playground for international tycoons.

97
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,120
Many girls are tricked and violated there,

98
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,440
yet no one dares report it,

99
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,600
so the police can only turn a blind eye.

100
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,480
That night,

101
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,280
surveillance outside Doll Bar showed

102
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:57,280
she was brought there by two female classmates.

103
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,240
Facial recognition technology has identified

104
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,080
the man who brought them into the bar

105
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,600
as Jin Junyi.

106
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:04,280
In this case,

107
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:05,280
he is the prime suspect.

108
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:07,160
I sent you his profile.

109
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,440
Jin Junyi!

110
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,640
Xiaoxiao?

111
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,560
Nightblade, I'm here.

112
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,680
Yan Sir, Xiaoxiao is outside.

113
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:39,880
Look.

114
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,200
Xiaoxiao can be saved.

115
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:47,040
Yan Sir.

116
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:47,600
Is she...?

117
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:48,720
She's someone you know.

118
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,200
I'll go get her.

119
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,240
She arrived so quickly!

120
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,400
Xiaoxiao...

121
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,800
Has something happened to her?

122
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,960
Our sister

123
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:15,280
is dying.

124
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,600
Xiaoxiao urgently needs a blood transfusion.

125
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,840
I will definitely uncover

126
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,960
the true mastermind behind harming our sister.

127
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:24,280
From now on in Stellarport,

128
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:25,880
you will

129
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,280
act as Xiaoxiao.

130
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:30,040
I sensed it,

131
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,920
so I rushed here to save her with you.

132
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:34,560
We will seek justice

133
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,200
for our sister!

134
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,840
We've received orders from Officer Chen.

135
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:49,080
You can take Jin Junyi and his accomplice

136
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,240
to Heisongpo.

137
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:56,080
(Move in the dark)

138
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:58,240
Is Xiaoxiao okay now?

139
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,440
Mr. Xiaoquan...

140
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,960
What is Zizhou's order?

141
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:05,840
They're coming out.

142
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,440
Wait for my signal.

143
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,360
Get ready.

144
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,200
What are you doing here?

145
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,080
This is a hospital.

146
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,600
How dare you cause trouble here!

147
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,800
I've been waiting for you.

148
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:24,640
You even hired thugs?

149
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,400
His teeth are knocked out.

150
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,960
Let me go, you bastard!

151
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:06,840
Let me go!

152
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:09,240
Do you think you can just walk out of this hospital?

153
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,840
My men are all over outside.

154
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:11,920
Everyone, get them!

155
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,880
Who are you with?

156
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,000
Talk, or you'll all be lying here.

157
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,160
They wouldn't dare say.

158
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,320
Just take them away.

159
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,560
Behave!

160
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:44,600
Stop them.

161
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:48,640
Stop the car.

162
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,960
Why didn't Zhengyan's men stop them?

163
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,920
These useless idiots!

164
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:11,160
Why do I hear police sirens?

165
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,480
Why did Du Juan ask me to meet at the construction site to check the ledger?

166
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,320
We could have done it at the company.

167
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,840
Where have all the workers gone?

168
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:23,960
Du Juan?

169
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,240
Du Juan?

170
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:31,880
Du Juan?

171
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:33,880
Du Juan?

172
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,800
Where are you?

173
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,480
This batch of steel bars is substandard.

174
00:10:56,680 --> 00:10:57,800
Then these steel bars cannot be used for buildings.

175
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,200
Or the buildings will collapse and cost lives!

176
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:03,720
Is this why Du Juan asked me to come?

177
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:08,160
This batch of building materials was purchased by Lu Gao and He Zhengnian.

178
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,560
Manager Zong?

179
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,440
At this late hour,

180
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:18,840
are you here to meet your old flame Du Juan?

181
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:20,000
What nonsense are you spouting?

182
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,600
Du Juan is my elder brother's wife.

183
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:22,600
Where is she?

184
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:23,400
Where is she?

185
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,120
In hell.

186
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:28,480
Waiting for you.

187
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,280
Lu Gao.

188
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:22,800
You're building the building with substandard steel bars.

189
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:25,360
Many people will die because of it.

190
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,960
You've done every evil deed.

191
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,000
Even as a ghost,

192
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:33,800
I won't spare you.

193
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:39,240
Then I'll let you die a lecherous ghost.

194
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,800
Go rip his pants off.

195
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,280
Before dying,

196
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,640
still thinking about doing bad?

197
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,720
Let me go!

198
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:25,760
Let me go!

199
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:28,800
Behave!

200
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,040
Let me go!

201
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:45,320
Xiaoquan,

202
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:47,160
let me introduce you to a friend.

203
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:52,600
I'm Mu Yi.

204
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:54,320
Zizhou.

205
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,920
We've brought Jin Junyi and Skinny here.

206
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,440
Both the Strait incident and Xiaoxiao's fall

207
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,880
are linked to the Zhengyan Group.

208
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:06,520
They're key for us to get the initial evidence.

209
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:07,880
Tonight...

210
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:09,360
We must get Jin Junyi to talk.

211
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:20,760
Don't mention it.

212
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:32,640
We're heading

213
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:33,640
to Heisongpo now.

214
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:34,320
Yes.

215
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:43,440
You bastard!

216
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:44,720
You piece of trash!

217
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,040
How dare you hit me, Jia Bao'er!

218
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,680
I'll have my mom deal with you.

219
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:48,960
Your mom?

220
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:50,240
Jia Bao'er?

221
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,320
Why not be Jia Baoyu?

222
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:52,760
You're just a young kid,

223
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:55,080
yet you stormed a hospital armed to beat people?

224
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,520
My bag!

225
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:04,520
My laptop!

226
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:05,600
They are important.

227
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:06,400
I can't lose them.

228
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,120
Find them.

229
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,440
Get to the hospital

230
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:15,160
and find Jin Junyi's laptop.

231
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:17,800
Yan Sir.

232
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:18,840
We're on it.

233
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:23,600
Speak up!

234
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:25,720
What happened before Xiaoxiao fell?

235
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,200
Let me go!

236
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:28,680
If my uncle finds out,

237
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,360
you'll definitely regret it!

238
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:32,480
Uncle?

239
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:35,600
You're so lame!

240
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,320
Just because of scum like you,

241
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,880
Stellarport is such a mess.

242
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,440
No one can save you now.

243
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,000
Tell us the truth.

244
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,680
You are Yan Xiaoxiao's brother?

245
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,440
How dare you take me here?
